# With optimization.packageScope limited to androidx/kotlin/kotlinx, R8 9.5.1 moved
# kotlin.sequences.SequencesKt___SequencesJvmKt to the root package but left its
# package-private superclass in kotlin.sequences: the release build then crashed
# at startup with IllegalAccessError. Keeping Kotlin's package names avoids it.
-keeppackagenames kotlin.**
